menu "EtherCAT axes"

    config ECAT_PATH
        bool "Two-axis interpolation in CSP (Manual > Interpolation, console 'path')"
        default n
        help
            Lines and arcs on two axes in cyclic synchronous position (6060 = 8), with the targets
            computed by the cyclic task. Off because the machine needs Profile Position only
            (CLAUDE.md, 2026-10-31): without it the cyclic task runs PP, PV and homing only, and
            the Manual page has no Interpolation view. Turn it on to test interpolation again.
            Still Free Run without DC: whether the drives accept CSP that way is unverified
            (docs/SLAVES_LEADSHINE.md section 6).

endmenu
